  {
    "id": 335,
    "name": "Module 2: Explaining Generative AI: What it is",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<p>In this module, participants will learn about artificial intelligence (AI) and generative AI (GenAI) in simple terms. The module explores GenAI's ability to understand, create, and synthesize knowledge based on training data.</p>",
    "summaryformat": 1,
    "section": 4,
    "hiddenbynumsections": 0,
    "uservisible": true,
    "component": null,
    "itemid": null,
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": 594,
        "url": "https://course.innovate-us.org/mod/scorm/view.php?id=594",
        "name": "Explaining Generative AI: What it is",
        "instance": 53,
        "contextid": 15597,
        "description": "<div class=\"no-overflow\"><h4>Module 2: Explaining Generative AI: What it is</h4>\r\n<p>In this module, participants will learn about artificial intelligence (AI) and generative AI (GenAI) in simple terms. The module explores GenAI's ability to understand, create, and synthesize knowledge based on training data. Examples demonstrate GenAI's capabilities in generating text, images, and engaging in multi-modal interaction, as well as its potential to save time and improve outcomes in government work.</p>\r\n<p>Click \"Start Module\" to begin! This module may take a few moments to load on slower connections. Thank you for your patience!</p>\r\n<p> Have questions or need assistance? Write to us at  <a href=\"mailto:hello@innovate-us.org\">hello@innovate-us.org</a></p></div>",
        "visible": 1,
        "uservisible": true,
        "visibleoncoursepage": 1,
        "modicon": "https://course.innovate-us.org/theme/image.php/norse/scorm/1795104600/monologo?filtericon=1",
