    "id": 312,
    "name": "Up Next: Understanding Risks and Building Resilience",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<p>After completing Course 1: Using Generative AI in Government, proceed to Course 2: Understanding Risks and Building Resilience, which examines responsible GenAI use by addressing bias, privacy, deepfakes, misinformation, and broader societal impacts.</p>",
    "summaryformat": 1,
    "section": 8,
    "hiddenbynumsections": 0,
    "uservisible": true,
    "component": null,
    "itemid": null,
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": 524,
        "url": "https://course.innovate-us.org/mod/url/view.php?id=524",
        "name": "Understanding Risks and Building Resilience",
        "instance": 45,
        "contextid": 9058,
        "description": "<div class=\"no-overflow\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Once you have completed Course 1: Using Generative in Government, we recommend moving on to Course 2 in the Responsible AI for Public Professionals series called \"Understanding Risks and Building Resilience\" in&nbsp;which you will learn how to use GenAI responsibly by exploring its risks—from bias and privacy concerns to deepfakes and misinformation—and understanding the broader societal impacts of this powerful technology.</p></div>",
        "visible": 1,
